    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Metal powders are some of the most critical raw materials involved in additive manufacturing and 3D printing. Flowability, morphology, and purity of the powder dictate the 3D printing process. These properties not only depend on the preparation process but are also dictated by the storage management of the metal powders once produced.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Why Metal Powder Storage Matters",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Behind any standardized requirement lies the lessons learned from past experiences. The metal powder quality directly contributes to mechanical properties, dimensional tolerances, and surface finish of printed components. Improper storage can lead to the following issues:",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": ": The metal powders are highly flammable, and improper storage can initiate a dust explosion or fire.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Therefore, scientific and rational storage procedures not only prolong the service life of powders but also ensure safety and stability of the printing process.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Factors Affecting Metal Powder Storage",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "1. General Standards for Metal Powder Storage",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Storage of metal powder needs to comply with stringent environmental control and packing requirements. To begin with, the storage containers have to be constructed from 304 or 316L stainless steel. Moreover, A double-layer sealing structure is coupled with",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "environment. Even if the particle size of reactive metal powders is >53μm, they need high-purity inert gas sealage. Argon or nitrogen, etc., should be inert gases with a purity of ≥99.999%.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Moreover, ambient temperature and humidity need to be strictly controlled. There should be a constant temperature in the storage area, preferably between (20±2)°C, and fluctuation not more than ±0.5°C per hour. Relative humidity should be controlled below 15%RH. Humidity should be further reduced to below 5%RH for nano-sized metal powders.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Powders must be stored in a clean, dry, and well-ventilated warehouse and must not be stored near acids, alkalis, corrosive substances, explosive/flammable substances, or reactive materials. Different categories of powders must have a minimum of 1.5 meters safety distance between them, but extremely reactive chemicals must have a distance of not less than 3 meters.",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Special Storage Requirements for Metal Powders",
    "url": "https://powder.samaterials.com/storage-tips-for-metal-powders-used-in-additive-manufacturing.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
